00:06:13.666 --> 00:06:15.866
Like taking a dig or a poke at you
像是輕輕酸你一下 或戳你一下

00:06:15.866 --> 00:06:18.766
Making fun of you in a light hearted, fun way
用很輕鬆好玩的方式鬧你

00:06:18.766 --> 00:06:20.083
So it's supposed to be funny
所以它的本意是好笑的

00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:24.200
And this type of humour is often seen as flirting
而這種幽默通常會被看成是在調情

